HST Office: the classic icon style (Cổ điển, hst_classic) is the default; the colourful one is the option.

Reason: the owner chose the classic style, Colibre plus the HST glyphs Colibre lacks, as the default,
with the colourful style ("Hiện đại", hst_modern) as an option. Automatic (SymbolStyle "auto", also
an unset style) now prefers hst_classic / hst_classic_dark, then hst_modern / hst_modern_dark, then
hst / hst_dark. Explicit values are unchanged: "hst_modern" selects the colourful style, and
"hst_classic", "hst" and "hst_dark" select the classic one, each following the UI mode.

Applies after hst-icon-theme-modern-default.patch and hst-icon-theme-classic-colibre.patch.
Test: make CppunitTest_vcl_app_test (test_IconThemeSelector).
License: upstream files remain MPL-2.0.
